      {
        "label": "Stop is left out",
        "text": "range(start, stop) starts at start and stops before stop, so range(1, 5) gives 1, 2, 3, 4."
      },
      {
        "label": "Reaching the last number",
        "text": "To include 5 in a loop, write the stop as 6, one more than the last number you want."
      },
      {
        "label": "Counting the numbers",
        "text": "The count of numbers range gives is stop minus start, so range(1, 6) gives 5 numbers."
